  "releaseNotes": "## v1.32.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v1.31.0:\n\n- Say the same definitions in the vocabulary the schema has now [minor] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Migrate 26 schemas to the current format and keep them as a breadth suite [minor] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Make a promising class the same bytes in C# as in C++ [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
